# The Blue Water Mystery

Inspired by Wifey.

A legendary quest exists:

## The Search For Azure Heart

Stories speak of water so blue it appears to glow.

Players hear rumors from sailors.

Nobody knows where it is.

Many players may spend years searching.

Finding it unlocks:

* rare resources
* tropical settlements
* hidden civilizations
* special cosmetic rewards

The bluest waters become famous locations.

---

# The First Ring

The Inner Realm is surrounded by an enormous frozen barrier.

Most citizens think it is simply the end of the world.

Governments maintain stations there.

Expeditions disappear.

The barrier contains:

* blue ice
* hidden tunnels
* ancient machinery
* forgotten records

Eventually players discover passages through the ice.

Crossing the First Ring changes everything.

---

# Outside The Ring

Players discover the world is vastly larger than believed.

Civilizations from previous Ages existed beyond the barrier.

Each realm represents a former world power.

---

# Realm: The Sea of Crowns

(M's Pirate Realm)

This is where pirate gameplay truly begins.

Features:

* hundreds of islands
* hidden coves
* sea monsters
* naval warfare
* treasure hunting

Players can:

* command ships
* recruit crews
* create fleets
* establish pirate ports
* become merchants
* become privateers
* become pirate kings

Resources matter.

Ships require:

* food
* wood
* tar
* tools
* medicine
* navigation charts

Crew morale matters.

